TI  - A Comparison of the Consistency of Adaptive Changes in Biomotor Abilities Induced by Interval Training Individualized Using the 30–15 Intermittent Fitness Test Vs. Time-Matched Small-Sided Games in Well-Trained Soccer Players
PY  - 2026
