TI  - Effects of Time-Based and Distance-Based Repeated Sprint Training on Physical and Physiological Adaptations in Collegiate Basketball Players
PY  - 2026
T2  - International Journal of Sports Physiology and Performance
VL  - 21
IS  - 9
