TI  - COMPARATIVE ANALYSIS OF TRAINING LOAD PLANNING MODELS FOR DOMESTIC AND FOREIGN TRIATHLETES IN THE STRUCTURE OF THE ANNUAL CYCLE
PY  - 2025
