AB  - The article describes the features of non-intrusive load monitoring (NILM) technology during energy audits. NILM technology allows you to determine the energy parameters of networks and consumer devices without direct access to individual installations by disaggregating the total input electrical parameters, which ensures the efficiency, efficiency and efficiency of the procedure for collecting the necessary energy audit data. When it is necessary to transmit a signal over a long distance, it is necessary to take into account the preservation of the accuracy of its form when converting to digital and analog forms, since the signal form is the main source of information during non-intrusive monitoring and audit. © 2025 American Institute of Physics Inc.. All rights reserved.
