TI  - The Influence of Athletic Profile on Acute Neuromuscular Response to a Repeated Sprint Protocol in Youth Females: A Pilot Study
PY  - 2025
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 39
IS  - 7
SP  - 760
EP  - 769
