TI  - Validity and Sensitivity of a Submaximal Fitness Test for Assessing Cardiorespiratory Fitness and Response to Preseason Training Load in Female Football Players
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Journal of Sports Physiology and Performance
VL  - 20
IS  - 4
