TI  - Unresisted Sprints Versus Heavy Resisted Sled Training: Relationships with Performance Indicators and Implications for Training Prescription in Elite Youth Rugby Players
PY  - 2025
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 39
IS  - 9
SP  - 989
EP  - 995
