TI  - Mind the Gap: Comparison of External Load and Load Variation Between a Reserve Team in a 1-Game Week Microcycle and Its First Team in a 2-Game Week Microcycle Within an Elite Professional Soccer Club
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 38
IS  - 5
