TI  - The Relationship between the Anaerobic Speed Reserve and Acute Responses to High-Intensity Interval Training in Female Soccer Players
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 38
IS  - 11
SP  - 1911
EP  - 1916
