TI  - Inconsistent Effect of Psychometric-Scale Familiarization on the Relationship Between Ratings of Perceived Exertion and External Load Measures in Elite Youth Soccer Players
PY  - 2023
T2  - International Journal of Sports Physiology and Performance
VL  - 18
IS  - 11
