TI  - THE CORRELATION BETWEEN BODY COMPOSITION AND AEROBIC ENDURANCE AS A PREDICTOR OF SPORTS PERFORMANCE IN 16–18-YEAR-OLD SWIMMERS
PY  - 2024
T2  - Rehabilitation and Recreation
VL  - 18
