TI  - Could Orthostatic Stress Responses Predict Acute Mountain Sickness Susceptibility Prior to High Altitude Travel? A Pilot Study
PY  - 2023
T2  - High Altitude Medicine and Biology
VL  - 24
IS  - 1
SP  - 19
EP  - 26
