TI  - Do non-contact injuries occur during high-speed running in elite football? Preliminary results from a novel GPS and video-based method
PY  - 2023
T2  - Journal of Science and Medicine in Sport
VL  - 26
IS  - 9
SP  - 465
EP  - 470
