TI  - Summated training and match load predictors of salivary immunoglobulin-A, alpha-amylase, testosterone, cortisol and T:C profile changes in elite-level professional football players: A longitudinal analysis
PY  - 2022
T2  - European Journal of Sport Science
VL  - 22
IS  - 8
