TI  - A Recreational Swimming Intervention during the Whole School Year Improves Fitness and Cardiometabolic Risk in Children and Adolescents with Overweight and Obesity
PY  - 2022
T2  - International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health
VL  - 19
IS  - 24
