TI  - Impact of high-intensity interval and moderate-intensity continuous exercise on heart rate variability and cardiac troponin
PY  - 2021
T2  - Journal of Sports Medicine and Physical Fitness
VL  - 61
IS  - 9
SP  - 1301
EP  - 1308
