TI  - Exercise-Induced Cardiac Fatigue in Recreational Ultramarathon Runners at Moderate Altitude: Insights From Myocardial Deformation Analysis
PY  - 2021
T2  - Frontiers in Cardiovascular Medicine
VL  - 8
C7  - 744393
