TI  - Short-term ubiquinol-10 supplementation alleviates tissue damage in muscle and fatigue caused by strenuous exercise in male distance runners
PY  - 2021
T2  - International Journal for Vitamin and Nutrition Research
VL  - 91
IS  - 3-4
