TI  - Using an Inertial Device (WIMU PRO) to Quantify Neuromuscular Load in Running: Reliability, Convergent Validity, and Influence of Type of Surface and Device Location
PY  - 2020
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 34
IS  - 2
SP  - 365
EP  - 373
