TI  - Real-time strategy based on feedforward fuzzy to manage the PEM fuel cell based micro-combined-heat-and power system
PY  - 2020
T2  - Proceedings - 2020 Chinese Automation Congress, CAC 2020
C7  - 9326962
SP  - 7337
