TI  - Most demanding passages in elite futsal: An isolated or a repeat situation?
PY  - 2020
T2  - Apunts. Educacion Fisica y Deportes
IS  - 142
SP  - 80
EP  - 84
DO  - 10.5672/APUNTS.2014-0983.ES.(2020/4).142.10
