TI  - THE EFFECT OF SHORT- AND LONG-TERM AEROBIC TRAINING YEARS ON SYSTEMIC O2 UTILIZATION, AND MUSCLE AND PREFRONTAL CORTEX TISSUE OXYGEN EXTRACTION IN YOUNG WOMEN
