TI  - Monitoring stress and recovery states: Structural and external stages of the short version of the RESTQ sport in elite swimmers before championships
PY  - 2019
T2  - Journal of Sport and Health Science
VL  - 8
IS  - 1
SP  - 77
EP  - 88
