AB  - The advanced instrumental technique for research and control of the motivation of the experimental animals under the weak microwave electromagnetic radiation are suggested. The microwave is modulated by interval patterns. The results of these physiological and metabolites experiments showed that long-distance low-intensive, special coded microwave exposition can change the current motivations and corresponding behavior of animals. These results can be used in the studies of the fundamental brain mechanisms and in the medicine. © 2018 The Authors. Published by Elsevier B.V.
