TI  - Distinct Effects of Repeated-Sprint Training in Normobaric Hypoxia and β-Alanine Supplementation
PY  - 2019
T2  - Journal of the American College of Nutrition
VL  - 38
IS  - 2
SP  - 149
EP  - 161
