TI  - Effect of Overload and Tapering on Individual Heart Rate Variability, Stress Tolerance, and Intermittent Running Performance in Soccer Players during a Preseason
PY  - 2019
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 33
IS  - 5
