AB  - The theme of the work is the effectiveness of chosen tools of training load on the sports performance in long triathlon of men. In our work we try to find out the efficiency of chosen training tools on the sports performance in individual annual cycles as well as in the three years cycle. We analyse the general and special figures. The results show the significance between the training load and the level or the changes of special sports performance in the disciplines of triathlon. On the base of analyse we evaluate the sports training in year of monitoring. From the work results point of view, the synchronous and asynchronous time data have the significant value. These data show the efficiency of training load from time adaptive efficiency point of view on the sports performance in individual disciplines of triathlon as a whole. In three annual training cycles the most significant correlation is seen in the time shift of twelve weeks, which we found out in correlation to sports performance in triathlon. © 2015, Univerzitet u Travniku. All rights reserved.
