TI  - A high-intensity intermittent-based running programme allows triathletes to reduce weekly running distances without impairing muscular performance and body composition
PY  - 2016
T2  - Isokinetics and Exercise Science
VL  - 24
IS  - 4
SP  - 313
EP  - 321
