TI  - Combined aerobic and strength training and energy expenditure in older women
PY  - 2013
T2  - Medicine and Science in Sports and Exercise
VL  - 45
IS  - 7
SP  - 1386
EP  - 1393
DO  - 10.1249/MSS.0b013e3182860099
