TI  - Monitoring internal load parameters during competitive synchronized swimming duet routines in elite athletes
PY  - 2014
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 28
IS  - 3
SP  - 742
EP  - 751
DO  - 10.1519/JSC.0b013e3182a20ee7
