TI  - Aerobic training normalizes autonomic dysfunction, HMGB1 content, microglia activation and inflammation in hypothalamic paraventricular nucleus of SHR
PY  - 2015
T2  - American Journal of Physiology - Heart and Circulatory Physiology
VL  - 309
IS  - 7
