TI  - Prior heavy-intensity exercise's enhancement of oxygen-uptake kinetics and short-term high-intensity exercise performance independent of aerobic-training status
PY  - 2015
T2  - International Journal of Sports Physiology and Performance
VL  - 10
IS  - 3
SP  - 339
