TI  - Low-volume, high-intensity, aerobic interval exercise for sedentary adults: V̇O2max, cardiac mass, and heart rate recovery
PY  - 2014
T2  - European Journal of Applied Physiology
VL  - 114
IS  - 9
SP  - 1963
