AB  - A software library (HRVKit) for performing heart rate variability (HRV) analysis and capable of running on Apple's iOS mobile hardware platforms has been developed. The software implements both time and frequency analysis techniques common to HRV in real time and also performs all necessary data preparation steps including filtering, detrending, and resampling. Results have been compared using Kubios as a reference and overall high levels of agreement have been found. © 2012 IADIS.
