TI  - Iron status is associated with endurance performance and training in female rowers
PY  - 2012
T2  - Medicine and Science in Sports and Exercise
VL  - 44
IS  - 8
SP  - 1552
EP  - 1559
DO  - 10.1249/MSS.0b013e3182517ceb
