TI  - Importance of characteristics and modalities of physical activity and exercise in the management of cardiovascular health in individuals with cardiovascular risk factors: Recommendations from the EACPR (Part II)
PY  - 2012
T2  - European Journal of Preventive Cardiology
VL  - 19
IS  - 5
