TI  - Relationship between muscular strength and sprints with changes of direction
PY  - 2012
T2  - Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research
VL  - 26
IS  - 3
SP  - 725
EP  - 732
DO  - 10.1519/JSC.0b013e31822602db
