AB  - The monitor process of athletes' training function is the basis to make the training move towards the preset aims. It also plays a key role in improving athletic ability, preventing exercise-induced fatigue and swift recovery. In order to make the monitor process in swimming training intelligent, automatic and dynamic, a monitor software has been developed based on Visual Basic 6.0 and Microsoft Access 2003 in the operating system Microsoft Windows 98SE / NT/ Me / 2000 / XP with information management functions about the monitor and evaluation of athletes' physical fitness, function recovery instruction and training etc. And some relevant database has been established to give dynamic analyses about athletes' Physiological Biochemical Index and objective assessment about athletes' physical fitness which can offer individual therapy to the potential or existing problems. The software is mainly applied to the function assessment about athletes' Physiological Biochemical Index; meanwhile, the computerized management is an aid for coaches in making daily training plans, counting the training load and monitoring the swimmers' physical fitness. ©2009 IEEE.
