TI  - Case study: Nutrition and hydration status during 4,254 km of running over 78 consecutive days
PY  - 2013
T2  - International Journal of Sport Nutrition and Exercise Metabolism
VL  - 23
IS  - 5
SP  - 533
EP  - 541
DO  - 10.1123/ijsnem.23.5.533
