TI  - O2 consumption of mechanically unloaded contractions of mouse left ventricular myocardial slices
PY  - 2004
T2  - American Journal of Physiology - Heart and Circulatory Physiology
VL  - 287
IS  - 1 56-1
SP  - H54
EP  - H62
