TI  - Effects of Running Distance and Training on Ca2+ Content and Damage in Human Muscle
PY  - 2004
T2  - Medicine and Science in Sports and Exercise
VL  - 36
IS  - 5
SP  - 821
EP  - 829
DO  - 10.1249/01.MSS.0000126468.65714.60
