TI  - Session RPE following interval and constant-resistance cycling in hot and cool environments
PY  - 2007
T2  - Medicine and Science in Sports and Exercise
VL  - 39
IS  - 11
SP  - 2051
EP  - 2057
DO  - 10.1249/mss.0b013e318148bddf
