AB  - Analysis based on the Eulerian criterion of stability is presented. The system of six homogeneous nonlinear difference equations with constant coefficients is obtained and the critical values of the external loads and buckling modes of the girders are evaluated. A series of the loading conditions in the whole range of the distance of the pole from the point of load application are examined.
