TI  - Vagally mediated heart rate recovery after exercise is accelerated in athletes but blunted in patients with chronic heart failure
PY  - 1994
T2  - Journal of the American College of Cardiology
VL  - 24
IS  - 6
SP  - 1529
EP  - 1535
DO  - 10.1016/0735-1097(94)90150-3
