TI  - Substrate utilization during endurance exercise in men and women after endurance training
PY  - 2001
T2  - American Journal of Physiology - Endocrinology and Metabolism
VL  - 280
IS  - 6 43-6
SP  - E898
EP  - E907
DO  - 10.1152/ajpendo.2001.280.6.e898
